 ('Why inventory matters', 'Stock is cash on a shelf.', ['Too little loses sales; too much ties up cash and spoils.', 'Costs: purchase, storage, loss, capital.', 'Goal: enough, not extra.', 'Know your lead time.'], '500 of goods sits 90 days; holding cost 2% a month ties up 30.', 'List holding costs for three items.', 'Costs with currency.'),
